  "short_description": "<p>Elegant bamboo tray with shimmering mother of pearl inlay. Handcrafted, sustainable, and perfect for serving or decorating.</p>",
  "description": "<p data-start=\"243\" data-end=\"551\">This <strong data-start=\"248\" data-end=\"271\">bamboo serving tray</strong> is elevated with exquisite <strong data-start=\"299\" data-end=\"330\">mother of pearl (MOP) inlay</strong>, bringing a luxurious yet natural charm to any space. Carefully handcrafted in Vietnam, it combines eco-friendly bamboo with the shimmering beauty of real seashell, creating a piece that’s both functional and decorative.</p>\n<p data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"818\">Perfect for serving tea, coffee, snacks, or as a stylish display piece for candles and decor. Lightweight yet durable, this tray reflects traditional craftsmanship with a modern touch — ideal for homes, hotels, and gift shops that value sustainability and elegance.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"823\" />\n<p data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"977\">\n<p data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1145\">\n<p data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1324\">\n<h3 data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1354\"><strong data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1352\">Key Features:</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1753\">\n<li data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1426\">\n<p data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1426\">🌿 <strong data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1387\">Sustainable Bamboo Base</strong> – Lightweight, strong, and renewable</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1427\" data-end=\"1497\">\n<p data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1497\">✨ <strong data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1461\">Real Mother of Pearl Inlay</strong> – Adds natural shine and elegance</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1586\">\n<p data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1586\">✋ <strong data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1537\">Handcrafted by Skilled Artisans</strong> – Made in Vietnam using traditional techniques</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1671\">\n<p data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1671\">🍵 <strong data-start=\"1592\" data-end=\"1616\">Multi-functional Use</strong> – Serve drinks, snacks, or use as a decorative piece</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1753\">\n<p data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1753\">🎁 <strong data-start=\"1677\" data-end=\"1698\">Gift-Ready Design</strong> – Ideal for stylish home décor or thoughtful gifting</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1755\" data-end=\"1758\" />\n<p data-start=\"1760\" data-end=\"1960\"><strong data-start=\"1760\" data-end=\"1780\">Have an inquiry?</strong><br data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1783\" />We’d love to hear from you.<br data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1813\" />📧 Email: <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1823\" data-end=\"1846\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com</a><br data-start=\"1846\" data-end=\"1849\" />📞 Phone/WhatsApp: +84-975-810-168<br data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1886\" />Let us assist with your wholesale order, customization, or shipping needs.</p>",
